# FlintBench publishes only what makes the dashboard run, plus its README, license and
# screenshots. Everything else in this folder stays local: the list below ignores the whole
# folder first, then lets back in exactly what belongs to the repository.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/app/
!/docs/

# never, even inside the folders let in above
node_modules/
data/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
